// Texture-resolution test bed on Eden (Everon), daylight: the pipeline's photo
// mission with a second addon. One stock player only; the tests create the
// creature, the panels and the scale props from script. addOns[] names both
// addons of @kj_texres: a runtime create of a class whose owner addon is not
// activated is refused.
